WEBVTT

00:00:57.345 --> 00:01:01.766
It does not matter where you came from
or how you got here.

00:01:02.725 --> 00:01:04.977
Diego and Wendy did just that.

00:01:05.645 --> 00:01:06.813
Within a few days,

00:01:06.854 --> 00:01:10.650
they found themselves inside
that Pennsylvania immigration prison.

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:14.529
Two among half a million people

00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:17.782
who will be locked up every single year,

00:01:17.824 --> 00:01:19.450
while the government decides

00:01:19.492 --> 00:01:22.787
if they will be allowed to stay
in the United States.

00:01:24.038 --> 00:01:25.623
Instead of a fair match

00:01:25.623 --> 00:01:30.086
between a prosecutor
and a defense attorney,